📊 Sales and Customer Analysis Dashboard  
Manageperts Business Intelligence Project  
By: Sarah Bazlamit

---

📌 Overview

This project presents an interactive **Power BI dashboard** designed to analyze business performance across **sales, customers, time, and store operations**.

The dashboard allows users to:
- Analyze **revenue and quantity trends over time**
- Understand **customer behavior and segmentation**
- Evaluate **store performance across regions and store types**

---

🧠 Tools Used

- Microsoft Power BI  
- Power Query (Data Cleaning & Transformation)  
- Data Modeling (Star Schema)  

---

🧩 Dataset

The analysis is based on four main tables:
- Customers  
- Products  
- Stores  
- Transaction  

---

📊 Dashboard Pages

⏳ Time Analysis
- Revenue trends over time  
- KPI cards for key metrics  

👥 Customer Analysis
- Revenue by customer  
- Member card segmentation  
- Income-based insights  

🏪 Store Analysis
- Revenue by store and country  
- Store performance comparison  

---

📈 Key Insights

- Revenue increased between 2007–2008 and peaked in early 2009  
- A small number of customers generate most of the revenue  
- Mid-income customers contribute the highest sales  
- Supermarkets outperform other store types  

